{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TREMEN takes you to the desolate world of comic book artist Pim Bos, featuring classic gameplay inspired by Quake, Doom, Soldier of Fortune and Wolfenstein with modern graphics powered by Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players fight their way through various concrete mega structures, deserts, snowy mountains and misty fields while encountering a wide variety of enemies such as babyboomers that blow themsleves up when they get to you, pig/dog chimeras, laser wielding dominatrices and many more while using a wide range of weaponry like spiked clubs, chainsaws, machineguns, rocketlaunchers and teslaguns. TREMEN brings you adrenaline pumping action that keeps you on the edge of your seat during your entire playthrough.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1641570?t=1756462212","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1641570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756462212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1641570/c199f4a3840ea012163162c22589c6be3cd6b586/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756462212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1641570/c199f4a3840ea012163162c22589c6be3cd6b586/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756462212","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Tremen includes some violent/gory combat scenes and environments.\r\n\r\nSome of the story and characters describe and participate in drug use."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TREMEN takes you to the desolate world of comic book artist Pim Bos, featuring classic gameplay inspired by Quake, Doom, Soldier of Fortune and Wolfen